<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - PHILIPS H1 NORMAL NET NLG 1.15 BN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - PHILIPS H1 NORMAL NET NLG 1.15 BN.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from normal ops	    1,153 vs    681</p>
<p>    Net/shr from normal ops (guilders)   3.31  vs   1.99</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain			  481  vs    445 loss</p>
<p>    Total net profit			  1,634  vs    236</p>
<p>    Total net/shr (guilders)		 4.69  vs   0.69</p>
<p>    Net sales				  33,386  vs 31,799</p>
<p>    Income from operations		  1,990  vs  1,243</p>
<p>    Financial charges			   391  vs    466</p>
<p>    Income before taxes		     1,599  vs    777</p>
<p>    Income taxes				  400  vs    155</p>
<p>    Contribution from associates	     44  vs    203</p>
<p>    Minorities				     90  vs    144</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Philips Electronics NV to</p>
<p>report first-half net profit from normal operations of 889/1000</p>
<p>million guilders with a consensus around 951 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
